/span><span begin="00:52.310" end="00:52.940">small </span><span begin="00:52.940" end="00:53.360">world </span><span begin="00:53.360" end="00:53.600">on </span><span begin="00:53.600" end="00:53.750">an </span><span begin="00:53.750" end="00:54.710">exceptionally </span><span begin="00:54.710" end="00:55.400">rainy </span><span begin="00:55.400" end="00:56.090">Tuesday </span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.810">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.140" end="00:59.150"><span begin="00:57.140" end="00:57.320">In </span><span begin="00:57.320" end="00:57.440">the </span><span begin="00:57.440" end="00:57.860">right </span><span begin="00:57.860" end="00:58.370">place </span><span begin="00:58.370" end="00:58.580">and </span><span begin="00:58.580" end="00:59.150">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.150" end="01:03.920"><span begin="00:59.150" end="00:59.420">When </span><span begin="00:59.420" end="00:59.630">the </span><span begin="00:59.630" end="01:00.380">zeros </span><span begin="01:00.380" end="01:00.740">line </span><span begin="01:00.740" end="01:00.980">up </span><span begin="01:00.980" end="01:01.310">on </span><span begin="01:01.310" end="01:01.490">the </span><span begin="01:01.490" end="01:01.520">24</span><span begin="01:01.520" end="01:02.570">-</span><span begin="01:02.570" end="01:03.020">hour </span><span begin="01:03.020" end="01:03.920">clock</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.980" end="01:08.390"><span begin="01:03.980" end="01:04.370">When </span><span begin="01:04.370" end="01:04.550">you </span><span begin="01:04.550" end="01:04.940">know </span><span begin="01:04.940" end="01:05.210">who's </span><span begin="01:05.210" end="01:05.900">calling </span><span begin="01:05.900" end="01:06.470">even </span><span begin="01:06.470" end="01:06.920">though </span><span begin="01:06.920" end="01:07.040">the </span><span begin="01:07.040" end="01:07.760">number </span><span begin="01:07.760" end="01:07.970">is </span><span 